      "height": 150,
      "text": "STATUS (Feb 2026): thirdweb's x402 facilitator ALREADY supports Ink!\nthirdweb.com/ink lists x402 as a supported service (170+ EVM chains).\nCircle deploys native USDC on Ink — EIP-3009 compatible.\nThe 'AFTER' diagram is achievable TODAY with thirdweb.\nPaths:\n  1. Use thirdweb facilitator (production-ready, Ink supported)\n  2. Self-host via @x402/evm + eip155:57073 (full control)\n  3. Wait for Coinbase CDP to add Ink (unknown timeline)",
